Glitch Hunter is an adaptation of "Evil Glitch", created by Giovanni Beltran
(@agar3s) for js13kGames 2016. Game style, colors and logo style by Lorena Marquez.

Third-party code included in game.js:
- Bootstrap, WebGL helpers and build layout adapted from "Behind Asteroids"
  by Gaëtan Renaudeau (@gre).
- jsfxr / SfxrSynth by Thomas Vian, Apache License 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0), base64 WAV encoding by @maettig.
- TinyMusic by Kevin Ennis (MIT License).
- Easing functions from http://gizma.com/easing (Robert Penner's equations).
